error[dli::syntax::unterminated-block]: this block is opened with `{` and never closed — add the `}` that ends it.
  --> line 1:1
  |
1 | practice ward-form {
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ unclosed block
  |
  = what: a braced block was opened with `{` and never closed, so it runs to the end of the file
  = fix:  add the closing `}`
  = rule: an unclosed block would swallow every following record into one runaway body; the boundary is required so nothing after it is lost unseen  (koan 4 — nothing is silently dropped; 01-syntax.md §2)
